**Found it.** `orderTotal` taxed the full price instead of the discounted one.

Only 3 of 625 cases failed, all in `order totals`. They were the only rows with a discount and a tax both non-zero. Everything else hid the bug.

```js
function orderTotal(cents, discountPct, taxRate) {
  const discounted = applyDiscount(cents, discountPct);
  return applyTax(discounted, taxRate);
}
```

`src/pricing.js:39`. All 625 tests pass.
